  "title": "Vue3 数据表格页(分页 + 搜索 + 排序 + 操作列)",
  "embedText": "Vue3 数据表格 table 分页 搜索 过滤 排序 状态列 操作列 编辑 删除 后台列表页 el-table el-pagination CRUD 用户列表 订单列表 告警表格 告警列表 实时告警 处理状态 监控事件列表",
  "description": "现有源码是用户数据表格页,含顶部搜索框、Element Plus el-table 列排序、角色标签列、分页器和行操作按钮；可复用于订单列表，也可改造为实时告警、处理状态或监控事件列表",
  "files": [
    {
      "path": "src/views/DataList.vue",
      "content": "<template>\n  <div class=\"page\">\n    <div class=\"bar\">\n      <h2>用户列表</h2>\n      <div class=\"actions\">\n        <el-input v-model=\"query\" placeholder=\"搜索姓名 / 邮箱\" clearable style=\"width:240px\" prefix-icon=\"Search\" />\n        <el-button type=\"primary\" @click=\"add\">新增用户</el-button>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <el-table :data=\"pageData\" stripe border @sort-change=\"onSort\">\n      <el-table-column prop=\"id\" label=\"ID\" width=\"80\" sortable=\"custom\" />\n      <el-table-column prop=\"name\" label=\"姓名\" sortable=\"custom\" />\n      <el-table-column prop=\"email\" label=\"邮箱\" />\n      <el-table-column prop=\"role\" label=\"角色\" width=\"120\">\n        <template #default=\"{ row }\"><el-tag :type=\"row.role === 'admin' ? 'danger' : ''\">{{ row.role }}</el-tag></template>\n      </el-table-column>\n      <el-table-column prop=\"createTime\" label=\"创建时间\" sortable=\"custom\" width=\"180\" />\n      <el-table-column label=\"操作\" width=\"160\" fixed=\"right\">\n        <template #default=\"{ row }\">\n          <el-button size=\"small\" @click=\"edit(row)\">编辑</el-button>\n          <el-button size=\"small\" type=\"danger\" @click=\"remove(row)\">删除</el-button>\n        </template>\n      </el-table-column>\n    </el-table>\n    <el-pagination class=\"pager\" v-model:current-page=\"page\" v-model:page-size=\"size\" :total=\"filtered.length\" :page-sizes=\"[10, 20, 50]\" layout=\"total, sizes, prev, pager, next\" />\n  </div>\n</template>\n\n<script setup>\nimport { ref, computed } from 'vue'\nimport { ElMessage, ElMessageBox } from 'element-plus'\nconst roles = ['admin', 'user', 'user', 'user', 'guest']\nconst rows = ref(Array.from({ length: 87 }, (_, i) => ({\n  id: i + 1,\n  name: '用户' + String(i + 1).padStart(3, '0'),\n  email: `user${i + 1}@example.com`,\n  role: roles[i % roles.length],\n  createTime: new Date(Date.now() - i * 86400000).toLocaleString('zh-CN')\n})))\nconst query = ref('')\nconst page = ref(1)\nconst size = ref(10)\nconst sortKey = ref(''); const sortOrder = ref('')\nconst filtered = computed(() => {\n  let r = rows.value\n  if (query.value) r = r.filter(x => x.name.includes(query.value) || x.email.includes(query.value))\n  if (sortKey.value) r = [...r].sort((a, b) => {\n    const s = a[sortKey.value] > b[sortKey.value] ? 1 : -1\n    return sortOrder.value === 'descending' ? -s : s\n  })\n  return r\n})\nconst pageData = computed(() => filtered.value.slice((page.value - 1) * size.value, page.value * size.value))\nfunction onSort({ prop, order }) { sortKey.value = prop; sortOrder.value = order }\nfunction add() { ElMessage.info('打开新增弹窗(略)') }\nfunction edit(row) { ElMessage.info('编辑 ' + row.name) }\nasync function remove(row) {\n  await ElMessageBox.confirm(`确定删除 ${row.name}?`, '提示', { type: 'warning' })\n  rows.value = rows.value.filter(x => x.id !== row.id)\n  ElMessage.success('已删除')\n}\n</script>\n\n<style scoped>\n.page { padding: 24px; background: #fff; border-radius: 12px; }\n.bar { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; margin-bottom: 16px; }\n.actions { display: flex; gap: 12px; }\n.pager { margin-top: 16px; justify-content: flex-end; }\n</style>"
    }
  ],
  "qualityScore": 0.94,
